# HARSHGURUJI — PRIVATE CHAT SYSTEM

## Website: [www.webguruji.online](http://www.webguruji.online)

Build a complete, production-ready **private one-to-one messaging/chat system** for the existing HarshGuruJi / WebGuruJi website.

The chat system must be available only to authenticated/logged-in users. It must integrate with the website's existing authentication, user database, profile system, and overall design without breaking existing pages or functionality.

The experience should combine approximately **90% of the visual quality and interaction style of Instagram Direct Messages** with the practical messaging behavior of WhatsApp.

IMPORTANT:

* This is a CHAT-ONLY system.
* Do NOT add Instagram Reels.
* Do NOT add a public reel/video feed.
* Do NOT add a social media feed.
* Do NOT add unnecessary entertainment features.
* Main purpose: users finding friends and exchanging private messages.

